Typed runtime values derived from workflow config + environment resolution.

#### 4.1.4 Workspace

- `path`
- `workspace_key`
- `created_now`

#### 4.1.5 Run Attempt

- `issue_id`, `issue_identifier`, `attempt`, `workspace_path`, `started_at`, `status`, `error`

#### 4.1.6 Live Session Metadata

- `session_id`, `thread_id`, `turn_id`
- `codex_app_server_pid`
- `last_codex_event`, `last_codex_timestamp`, `last_codex_message`
